# Optional manual reads against already configured development hosts.
# Start no services from this file. See ../WALKTHROUGH.md.
# Replace placeholders locally; do not commit real tokens.
@productApi = https://localhost:7000
@cartApi = https://localhost:7003
@orderApi = https://localhost:7004
@accessToken = <local-customer-token>
@subject = <subject-from-login>
@orderId = <generated-order-id>

### Catalog: inspect isSuccess and result, not just HTTP 200.
GET {{productApi}}/api/product
Accept: application/json

### Own cart: missing resource 404; mismatched subject 403.
GET {{cartApi}}/api/cart/GetCart/{{subject}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Own generated order.
GET {{orderApi}}/api/order/GetOrder/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
